  "prefLabel": "Rev 2411.07 Estimated Tax Forms",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2411.07 Estimated Tax Forms. A business enterprise having an annual projected tax liability in excess of $260 shall complete and file the applicable estimated tax form:\n\n(a) Form NH-1040-ES, “Estimated Proprietorship Business Tax”;\n\n(b) Form NH-1041-ES “Estimated Fiduciary Business Tax”;\n\n(c) Form NH-1065-ES, “Estimated Partnership Business Tax”; or\n\n(d) Form NH-1120-ES, “Estimated Corporation Business Tax.”\n\nSource. #6130, eff 11-23-95; ss and moved by #7178, eff 12-23-99 (from Rev 2411.08), EXPIRED: 12-23-07\n\nNew. #9065, eff 1-10-08; ss by #10332, eff 5-9-13; ss by #11032, eff 1-29-16 (formerly Rev 2411.09); ss by #14573, eff 5-2-26, EXPIRES: 5-2-36",
